          { "text": "例：25×99 + 25 = 25×(99+1) = 2500", "x": 200, "y": 250, "fontSize": 13, "fill": "#9ca3af" }
        ],
        "formula": "a × (b + c) = a×b + a×c"
      },
      "hint": "一个数乘两个数的和 = 分别乘再相加"
